Do you feel dizzy, poisoned, or gag when smoking, but love the
smell & coffee-hit of cigarettes as you exhale from your nose?



* Get checked for H. pylori, bad stool, and food intolerances
  like gluten, dairy, soy, and artificial sweeteners.

* Pepto Bismol lets me smoke better
  because it gives me better stool.

* Some days, I smoke a handmade cigar before smoking cigarettes,
  and the cigarettes go down smoother. Just eat, hydrate, and
  don't inhale! My favorite cigar: Surplus by CAO, Maduro 5x50 ($4).
  Its smoke is an alien mind fuck! I like to waft it at my nose.
  Keep your cigars humidified with the packets sold in store!
  (A handmade cigar aka premium cigar is pure tobacco leaf that
  had sat there fermenting, where its natural oils age and
  become complex. Its smoke is truly the most interesting smell).
